  "description": "Hello team,\n\nOn\u202f20\u202fJanuary\u202f2022 at\u202f12:34:56\u202fUTC we recorded the Forge build list for Minecraft\u202f1.16.5 (snapshot\u202f1). The first entry, version\u202f36.2.0, was released on\u202f15\u202fJanuary\u202f2022 and is marked as a **common** release. Its installer can be found at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.16.5-36.2.0/forge-1.16.5-36.2.0-installer.jar` with SHA\u20111\u202f`a1b2c3d4e5f67890123456789abcdef12345678`, and the universal JAR is located at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.16.5-36.2.0/forge-1.16.5-36.2.0-universal.jar` (SHA\u20111\u202f`b2c3d4e5f67890123456789abcdef1234567890a`). The second entry, version\u202f36.2.1, arrived on\u202f10\u202fFebruary\u202f2022 as a **recommended** release. Its installer path is\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.16.5-36.2.1/forge-1.16.5-36.2.1-installer.jar` (SHA\u20111\u202f`c3d4e5f67890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1`) and the universal JAR resides at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.16.5-36.2.1/forge-1.16.5-36.2.1-universal.jar` (SHA\u20111\u202f`d4e5f67890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1c2`). A changelog for this release is available at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.16.5-36.2.1/changelog.txt` with SHA\u20111\u202f`e5f67890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1c2d3`.\n\nA later snapshot (snapshot\u202f2) was logged on\u202f5\u202fMay\u202f2023 at\u202f08:00:00\u202fUTC for Minecraft\u202f1.18.2. It contains a single **latest** build, version\u202f40.1.0, dated\u202f20\u202fApril\u202f2023. The installer JAR resides at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.18.2-40.1.0/forge-1.18.2-40.1.0-installer.jar` (SHA\u20111\u202f`f67890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1c2d3e4`) and the universal JAR at\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.18.2-40.1.0/forge-1.18.2-40.1.0-universal.jar` (SHA\u20111\u202f`67890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1c2d3e4f5`). Additionally, the MDK package can be downloaded from\u202f`net/minecraftforge/forge/1.18.2-40.1.0/forge-1.18.2-40.1.0-mdk.zip` with SHA\u20111\u202f`7890123456789abcdef1234567890ab1c2d3e4f5g`."
